feat(cr-f2c): add emit-routing gate for HirModule top-level constructs
scale: ~145 lines across 1 files [M]

- Add `emit_routing_gate.rs` integration test to ensure all `HirModule` top-level constructs are explicitly routed to either Rust, TypeScript, or both emit arms.
- The test uses a `classify` function to map `HirModule` field names to an `Arm` enum (RustArm, TsArm, Both).
- It exhaustively checks `HirModule`'s fields using `serde_json` to ensure any new fields added to `HirModule` will fail the test until classified.
- This prevents silent dropping or double-emitting of new top-level constructs.

